      "text": [
        "4108 - وَ قَالَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : فِي رَجُلٍ رَهَنَ عِنْدَ رَجُلٍ دَاراً فَاحْتَرَقَتْ أَوِ اِنْهَدَمَتْ قَالَ \"يَكُونُ مَالُهُ فِي تُرْبَةِ اَلْأَرْضِ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4108 - Imam (as) said regarding a man who pledged a house as security with another man, and the house either burned down or collapsed: \"His wealth remains in the soil of the land.\""
        ]
      }
